          "rationale": "importOrders 通过 this 语义调用 createOrder，REQUIRES_NEW 不会生效。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioKey": "cache-stampede",
      "name": "热点缓存失效后并发回源",
      "expectationType": "DEFECT",
      "rationale": "热点 Key 失效时所有请求都会访问数据库，缺少互斥、逻辑过期或请求合并。",
      "defects": [
        {
          "caseKey": "cache-stampede",
          "category": "CACHE",
